<%- include('../layouts/company-top', { title: '사업 영역', active: 'business' }) %>

<div class="page-banner">
  <div class="container">
    <nav aria-label="breadcrumb">
      <ol class="breadcrumb">
        <li class="breadcrumb-item"><a href="/">홈</a></li>
        <li class="breadcrumb-item active">사업 영역</li>
      </ol>
    </nav>
    <h1>사업 영역</h1>
    <p>ENERMADE가 제공하는 핵심 사업 분야를 소개합니다</p>
  </div>
</div>

<!-- 세라믹 가공 -->
<section class="sec-py" id="ceramic">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="row align-items-center g-5">
      <div class="col-12 col-lg-6">
        <span class="sec-label">Ceramic Processing</span>
        <h2 style="font-size:clamp(1.4rem,3vw,2rem);font-weight:800;margin-bottom:16px;">세라믹 가공</h2>
        <p class="txt-muted" style="font-size:15px;line-height:1.8;margin-bottom:24px;">
          알루미나, 지르코니아, 탄화규소 등 다양한 세라믹 소재를 고정밀 가공하여
          반도체, 전자, 에너지 산업에 최적화된 부품을 공급합니다.
          CNC 가공부터 연삭·연마까지 일관 공정 체계로 품질을 보장합니다.
        </p>
        <ul style="padding-left:0;list-style:none;display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:10px;">
          <li style="display:flex;align-items:flex-start;gap:10px;font-size:14px;color:var(--c-text-2);">
            <svg width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" style="margin-top:2px;flex-shrink:0;color:var(--c-accent)"><path d="M9 12l2 2 4-4m5 2a9 9 0 11-18 0 9 9 0 0118 0z" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round"/></svg>
            정밀 CNC 선삭 / 밀링 가공
          </li>
          <li style="display:flex;align-items:flex-start;gap:10px;font-size:14px;color:var(--c-text-2);">
            <svg width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" style="margin-top:2px;flex-shrink:0;color:var(--c-accent)"><path d="M9 12l2 2 4-4m5 2a9 9 0 11-18 0 9 9 0 0118 0z" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round"/></svg>
            경면 연삭 및 래핑 (Ra 0.05㎛ 이하)
          </li>
          <li style="display:flex;align-items:flex-start;gap:10px;font-size:14px;color:var(--c-text-2);">
            <svg width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" style="margin-top:2px;flex-shrink:0;color:var(--c-accent)"><path d="M9 12l2 2 4-4m5 2a9 9 0 11-18 0 9 9 0 0118 0z" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round"/></svg>
            소형 ~ 대형 부품 다품종 소량 대응
          </li>
        </ul>
      </div>
      <div class="col-12 col-lg-6">
        <div style="border-radius:var(--r-xl);overflow:hidden;aspect-ratio:4/3;background:var(--c-bg-2);display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;">
          <svg width="80" height="80" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" style="opacity:.2"><rect x="3" y="3" width="18" height="18" rx="2" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5"/></svg>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<!-- 정밀 부품 -->
<section class="sec-py-sm" id="precision" style="background:var(--c-bg-2);">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="row align-items-center g-5 flex-lg-row-reverse">
      <div class="col-12 col-lg-6">
        <span class="sec-label">Precision Parts</span>
        <h2 style="font-size:clamp(1.4rem,3vw,2rem);font-weight:800;margin-bottom:16px;">정밀 부품</h2>
        <p class="txt-muted" style="font-size:15px;line-height:1.8;margin-bottom:24px;">
          마이크론 단위의 치수 정밀도가 요구되는 산업용 정밀 부품을 설계·가공·검사하여 납품합니다.
          3차원 측정기(CMM)를 활용한 전수 검사로 신뢰성을 확보합니다.
        </p>
        <ul style="padding-left:0;list-style:none;display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:10px;">
          <li style="display:flex;align-items:flex-start;gap:10px;font-size:14px;color:var(--c-text-2);">
            <svg width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" style="margin-top:2px;flex-shrink:0;color:var(--c-accent)"><path d="M9 12l2 2 4-4m5 2a9 9 0 11-18 0 9 9 0 0118 0z" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round"/></svg>
            반도체 장비용 세라믹 척(Chuck) / 링(Ring)
          </li>
          <li style="display:flex;align-items:flex-start;gap:10px;font-size:14px;color:var(--c-text-2);">
            <svg width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" style="margin-top:2px;flex-shrink:0;color:var(--c-accent)"><path d="M9 12l2 2 4-4m5 2a9 9 0 11-18 0 9 9 0 0118 0z" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round"/></svg>
            치수 공차 ±2㎛ 이하 달성
          </li>
          <li style="display:flex;align-items:flex-start;gap:10px;font-size:14px;color:var(--c-text-2);">
            <svg width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" style="margin-top:2px;flex-shrink:0;color:var(--c-accent)"><path d="M9 12l2 2 4-4m5 2a9 9 0 11-18 0 9 9 0 0118 0z" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round"/></svg>
            CMM 전수 검사 성적서 제공
          </li>
        </ul>
      </div>
      <div class="col-12 col-lg-6">
        <div style="border-radius:var(--r-xl);overflow:hidden;aspect-ratio:4/3;background:var(--c-bg-3,#f1f5f9);display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;">
          <svg width="80" height="80" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" style="opacity:.2"><rect x="3" y="3" width="18" height="18" rx="2" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5"/></svg>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<!-- 특수 소재 -->
<section class="sec-py" id="materials">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="text-center mb-5">
      <span class="sec-label mx-auto justify-content-center" style="display:flex;">Special Materials</span>
      <h2 style="font-size:clamp(1.4rem,3vw,2rem);font-weight:800;margin-bottom:10px;">특수 소재</h2>
      <p class="txt-muted">극한 환경에서도 안정적인 성능을 발휘하는 특수 세라믹 소재를 공급합니다</p>
    </div>
    <div class="row g-4">
      <div class="col-12 col-md-6 col-lg-3">
        <div class="material-card">
          <div class="material-code">Al₂O₃</div>
          <div class="material-name">알루미나</div>
          <p class="material-desc">내열·내마모성 우수. 반도체·전자 부품 범용 소재.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="col-12 col-md-6 col-lg-3">
        <div class="material-card">
          <div class="material-code">ZrO₂</div>
          <div class="material-name">지르코니아</div>
          <p class="material-desc">고강도·고인성. 정밀 부품·의료기기·절삭 공구 적합.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="col-12 col-md-6 col-lg-3">
        <div class="material-card">
          <div class="material-code">SiC</div>
          <div class="material-name">탄화규소</div>
          <p class="material-desc">극한 고온·고압 환경 대응. 반도체 장비·산업용 히터.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="col-12 col-md-6 col-lg-3">
        <div class="material-card">
          <div class="material-code">Si₃N₄</div>
          <div class="material-name">질화규소</div>
          <p class="material-desc">내충격·열충격 저항. 엔진 부품·고속 베어링 적합.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<!-- 맞춤 제작 -->
<section class="sec-py-sm" id="custom" style="background:var(--c-bg-2);">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="row align-items-center g-5">
      <div class="col-12 col-lg-6">
        <span class="sec-label">Custom Manufacturing</span>
        <h2 style="font-size:clamp(1.4rem,3vw,2rem);font-weight:800;margin-bottom:16px;">맞춤 제작</h2>
        <p class="txt-muted" style="font-size:15px;line-height:1.8;margin-bottom:24px;">
          도면 또는 샘플을 바탕으로 고객 요구에 완전히 맞춘 부품을 설계·제작합니다.
          소량 시제품부터 양산까지 유연하게 대응하며, 엔지니어 직접 상담을 통해
          최적의 소재와 가공 방법을 제안합니다.
        </p>
        <div class="d-flex gap-3 flex-wrap">
          <a href="/contact" class="btn btn-dark">견적 문의</a>
          <a href="/shop/inquiries" class="btn btn-outline-dark">RFQ 제출</a>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="col-12 col-lg-6">
        <div class="row g-3">
          <div class="col-6">
            <div style="background:#fff;border:1px solid var(--c-border);border-radius:var(--r-xl);padding:20px;text-align:center;">
              <div style="font-size:2rem;font-weight:800;color:var(--c-accent);font-family:var(--font-head);line-height:1;">1주</div>
              <div style="font-size:12px;color:var(--c-muted);margin-top:4px;font-weight:600;">시제품 납기</div>
            </div>
          </div>
          <div class="col-6">
            <div style="background:#fff;border:1px solid var(--c-border);border-radius:var(--r-xl);padding:20px;text-align:center;">
              <div style="font-size:2rem;font-weight:800;color:var(--c-accent);font-family:var(--font-head);line-height:1;">1pc~</div>
              <div style="font-size:12px;color:var(--c-muted);margin-top:4px;font-weight:600;">최소 주문</div>
            </div>
          </div>
          <div class="col-6">
            <div style="background:#fff;border:1px solid var(--c-border);border-radius:var(--r-xl);padding:20px;text-align:center;">
              <div style="font-size:2rem;font-weight:800;color:var(--c-accent);font-family:var(--font-head);line-height:1;">24h</div>
              <div style="font-size:12px;color:var(--c-muted);margin-top:4px;font-weight:600;">견적 응답</div>
            </div>
          </div>
          <div class="col-6">
            <div style="background:#fff;border:1px solid var(--c-border);border-radius:var(--r-xl);padding:20px;text-align:center;">
              <div style="font-size:2rem;font-weight:800;color:var(--c-accent);font-family:var(--font-head);line-height:1;">ISO</div>
              <div style="font-size:12px;color:var(--c-muted);margin-top:4px;font-weight:600;">품질 인증</div>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<!-- CTA -->
<section class="cta-section">
  <div class="container text-center">
    <h2>맞춤형 세라믹 솔루션이 필요하신가요?</h2>
    <p>엔지니어에게 직접 문의하여 최적의 솔루션을 제안받으세요</p>
    <div class="d-flex gap-3 justify-content-center flex-wrap">
      <a href="/contact" class="btn btn-dark btn-lg">견적 문의하기</a>
      <a href="/shop/products" class="btn btn-outline-light btn-lg">상품 보러가기</a>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

